[2026-06-03 12:15:40] FlashInfer still incompatible with SM 12.0
Error: RuntimeError: FlashInfer requires GPUs with sm75 or higher

Solution: Use OpenAI-compatible entrypoint instead of default API server.
Command: python -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server --model /home/cheer/qwen2

Root cause: vLLM 0.22.0 default entrypoint ignores VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0,
but OpenAI entrypoint respects it and falls back to PyTorch-native sampler.
